{
  "bvid": "BV1zm9zYQE9U",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "b05b77977a6db4dc125d4c25bef631e79413253f8a3104d8f5ee320139c7330b",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 100,
      "end_ms": 1500,
      "text": "有一点得明说啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 1500,
      "end_ms": 4560,
      "text": "就是说绝对不准贵啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 4560,
      "end_ms": 9030,
      "text": "是字面意义上的下跪这件事情呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 9030,
      "end_ms": 11570,
      "text": "呃可以有豁免啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 11570,
      "end_ms": 12450,
      "text": "就是有豁免"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 12450,
      "end_ms": 15970,
      "text": "就是说如果你是传统儒教家族"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 15970,
      "end_ms": 20570,
      "text": "就是说由于是民族民民族传统嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 20570,
      "end_ms": 23450,
      "text": "就是说对于你的祖父母辈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 23450,
      "end_ms": 26130,
      "text": "如果有乡村有这样一种传统"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 26130,
      "end_ms": 29510,
      "text": "为了那个维护你父母的颜面啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 29510,
      "end_ms": 32830,
      "text": "比如说是农村的农村家庭出身的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 32830,
      "end_ms": 34530,
      "text": "什么爷爷奶奶死了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 34530,
      "end_ms": 35630,
      "text": "这个要跪啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 35630,
      "end_ms": 36270,
      "text": "守灵堂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 36270,
      "end_ms": 37570,
      "text": "这是豁免的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 37570,
      "end_ms": 42740,
      "text": "还有那个就是但是这些你是不认的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 42740,
      "end_ms": 47280,
      "text": "就是我们坚持无神论的立场啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 47280,
      "end_ms": 48600,
      "text": "然后呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 50499,
      "end_ms": 53559,
      "text": "原则上不允许去佛寺"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 53559,
      "end_ms": 54839,
      "text": "还有道观啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 54839,
      "end_ms": 56419,
      "text": "还有其他地那些"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 56419,
      "end_ms": 60640,
      "text": "就还有其他的宗教设施里面去呃祭拜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 60640,
      "end_ms": 62880,
      "text": "然后不允绝对不允许下跪啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 62880,
      "end_ms": 64640,
      "text": "然后呢如果是宗祠啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 64640,
      "end_ms": 67960,
      "text": "还有就是这个老人的那种坟呐"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 67960,
      "end_ms": 71430,
      "text": "那这个是出于民俗习俗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 71430,
      "end_ms": 74890,
      "text": "就是直系亲属要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 74890,
      "end_ms": 76260,
      "text": "那可以啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 76260,
      "end_ms": 77360,
      "text": "知清楚这些父母啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 77360,
      "end_ms": 78820,
      "text": "父母要求可以"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 78820,
      "end_ms": 80440,
      "text": "但是不认这个东西的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 80440,
      "end_ms": 83270,
      "text": "也就是说这个东西呢等到你父母死的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 83270,
      "end_ms": 86550,
      "text": "你来主持这个白氏葬仪啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 86550,
      "end_ms": 89530,
      "text": "要尽可能的要去除跪拜礼啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 89530,
      "end_ms": 91490,
      "text": "要鞠躬就行了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 91490,
      "end_ms": 92690,
      "text": "绝对不准跪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 94010,
      "end_ms": 97890,
      "text": "给爹娘跪也是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 99450,
      "end_ms": 104280,
      "text": "婚礼婚仪上面可以就是就是汉族传统吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 104280,
      "end_ms": 105300,
      "text": "要敬茶礼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 105300,
      "end_ms": 107400,
      "text": "这可以可以跪的敬茶礼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 107400,
      "end_ms": 108760,
      "text": "然后改改口啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 108760,
      "end_ms": 112550,
      "text": "这个就是婚丧嫁娶嘛婚然后丧礼上的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 112550,
      "end_ms": 115850,
      "text": "从你你父母的那一代起就要改"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 116580,
      "end_ms": 118300,
      "text": "尽量尽量争取去改"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 118300,
      "end_ms": 120900,
      "text": "如果说你母亲去世或者父亲去世"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 120900,
      "end_ms": 121500,
      "text": "一方去世"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 121500,
      "end_ms": 122340,
      "text": "另一方没去世"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 122340,
      "end_ms": 124260,
      "text": "然后在另外一方的要求下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 124260,
      "end_ms": 125340,
      "text": "要要要跪拜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 125340,
      "end_ms": 127250,
      "text": "这种就是叫传统丧礼的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 127250,
      "end_ms": 128370,
      "text": "那再说好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 128370,
      "end_ms": 131790,
      "text": "就是说也就是说你最后一个父母亲去世的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 131790,
      "end_ms": 136060,
      "text": "你要改成不跪拜的唉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 136060,
      "end_ms": 139180,
      "text": "要寄就到殡仪馆里面去鞠躬就行了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 140710,
      "end_ms": 143530,
      "text": "啊是这么一个要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 143530,
      "end_ms": 144250,
      "text": "然后呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 144250,
      "end_ms": 146710,
      "text": "除此之外一律不许跪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 150920,
      "end_ms": 152680,
      "text": "除非是受刑讯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 152680,
      "end_ms": 155720,
      "text": "或者说除非是就是受刑啦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 155720,
      "end_ms": 157570,
      "text": "被打啦啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 157570,
      "end_ms": 158290,
      "text": "然后没办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 158290,
      "end_ms": 159370,
      "text": "就是被揍了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 159370,
      "end_ms": 160030,
      "text": "你明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 160030,
      "end_ms": 162019,
      "text": "就是身体被强迫"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 162019,
      "end_ms": 163999,
      "text": "那么这是要反抗的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 163999,
      "end_ms": 164919,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 164919,
      "end_ms": 167810,
      "text": "除此外一律不得跪啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 167810,
      "end_ms": 169290,
      "text": "啧啧啧啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 169290,
      "end_ms": 170370,
      "text": "可以鞠躬"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 170370,
      "end_ms": 174430,
      "text": "但是绝对就是这是我们的一个要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 174430,
      "end_ms": 179070,
      "text": "就是无神论者要废弃跪拜礼啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 179070,
      "end_ms": 180370,
      "text": "废弃跪拜礼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 180370,
      "end_ms": 182830,
      "text": "然后但是逐步的渐进的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 182830,
      "end_ms": 184670,
      "text": "不是说一下子全取消的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 184670,
      "end_ms": 185720,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 185720,
      "end_ms": 188400,
      "text": "那你说汉民族主义者不要跟我扯这东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 188400,
      "end_ms": 189520,
      "text": "跪拜这玩意的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 190800,
      "end_ms": 192140,
      "text": "呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 192640,
      "end_ms": 196769,
      "text": "噗啊这个这个这个习俗呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 197129,
      "end_ms": 198329,
      "text": "反正我们废除啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 198329,
      "end_ms": 199729,
      "text": "反正我不是汉民族主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 199729,
      "end_ms": 202540,
      "text": "我也不认那传统儒教礼仪这玩意的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 202540,
      "end_ms": 203500,
      "text": "我有权限去改"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 203500,
      "end_ms": 204860,
      "text": "我有全都改掉的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 204860,
      "end_ms": 207540,
      "text": "好不好啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 211060,
      "end_ms": 212620,
      "text": "啊这这一点要明白"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 212620,
      "end_ms": 216540,
      "text": "然后另外一方面就是说这个呃宗教信仰方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 216540,
      "end_ms": 218200,
      "text": "就是坚持无神论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 218200,
      "end_ms": 222139,
      "text": "然后呢你如果有那种什么民俗教信仰的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 222139,
      "end_ms": 224419,
      "text": "那这些人要剔除啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 224419,
      "end_ms": 227130,
      "text": "有这个呃佛道啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 227130,
      "end_ms": 229550,
      "text": "还有其他的这个主流宗教那些信仰"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 229550,
      "end_ms": 233060,
      "text": "还尤其是不能有神秘主义信仰啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 233060,
      "end_ms": 233860,
      "text": "不能有迷信"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 233860,
      "end_ms": 235580,
      "text": "有神秘主义的那种倾向啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 235580,
      "end_ms": 236980,
      "text": "不能搞什么算命啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 236980,
      "end_ms": 238040,
      "text": "什么塔罗牌呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 238040,
      "end_ms": 240690,
      "text": "什么这些东西通通不允许玩啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 240690,
      "end_ms": 247469,
      "text": "发现一个就要剔除这个人这种形邪淫寺邪寺"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 247469,
      "end_ms": 251240,
      "text": "还有指望超自然力量去改变历史现实"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 251240,
      "end_ms": 255480,
      "text": "还有就是供奉祭拜通通不允许"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 257119,
      "end_ms": 258559,
      "text": "明白吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 263640,
      "end_ms": 271410,
      "text": "这个就是一个呃基本的一个一个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 271410,
      "end_ms": 273530,
      "text": "一个纪律好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 273530,
      "end_ms": 275210,
      "text": "基本的一个纪律"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 279720,
      "end_ms": 283160,
      "text": "哦然后还有就是灵魂这种说法的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 283160,
      "end_ms": 285360,
      "text": "这个对于无神论者的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 286560,
      "end_ms": 290410,
      "text": "嗯啊就是生命不朽啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 290410,
      "end_ms": 292590,
      "text": "还有什么灵魂形态这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 292590,
      "end_ms": 295250,
      "text": "它是尚属于哲学范畴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 295250,
      "end_ms": 296810,
      "text": "尚属于哲学范畴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 296810,
      "end_ms": 300010,
      "text": "但是说有一个前提就是不能信信仰"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 300010,
      "end_ms": 302570,
      "text": "有任何意义上的主宰啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 302570,
      "end_ms": 304770,
      "text": "就是物质自然力量背后的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 304770,
      "end_ms": 307430,
      "text": "它的运动是所有的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 307430,
      "end_ms": 312200,
      "text": "就精神性秩序的发生学机制发生的原理啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 312200,
      "end_ms": 313880,
      "text": "它是物质运动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 313880,
      "end_ms": 317720,
      "text": "鲜活的物质运动本身给它发生出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 317720,
      "end_ms": 321510,
      "text": "不是说天然流主宰设计好的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 321510,
      "end_ms": 323270,
      "text": "定性考的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 323270,
      "end_ms": 326210,
      "text": "那么这个主宰啊就是说我们不承认有主宰"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 326210,
      "end_ms": 328870,
      "text": "我们认为物质现实它是复数化的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 328870,
      "end_ms": 334260,
      "text": "都是整个宇宙的根本秩序的参与的制定者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 334260,
      "end_ms": 338630,
      "text": "所有的物质都是在这上是平等的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 338630,
      "end_ms": 341820,
      "text": "然后另外一方面是关于灵魂不朽这个东西呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 341820,
      "end_ms": 343220,
      "text": "我们之前也已经讨论过了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 343220,
      "end_ms": 345040,
      "text": "他并不在任何意义上讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 345040,
      "end_ms": 347960,
      "text": "有一个持续的一个载体呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 347960,
      "end_ms": 350720,
      "text": "啊有一个实质性的一个灵魂啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 350720,
      "end_ms": 352580,
      "text": "作为一个物质在里面一直运行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 352580,
      "end_ms": 353720,
      "text": "延续着这么一个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 353720,
      "end_ms": 356909,
      "text": "但是呢我们坚持的是精神不朽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 356909,
      "end_ms": 360470,
      "text": "就是对于这个整个宇宙呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 360470,
      "end_ms": 364810,
      "text": "历史秩序的他的深刻的变化的追求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 364810,
      "end_ms": 366290,
      "text": "这样一种意志"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 366290,
      "end_ms": 372350,
      "text": "还有那样一种强烈的希冀和欲望和愿望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 372350,
      "end_ms": 378430,
      "text": "和那种啊超群绝伦的那种努力啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 378430,
      "end_ms": 382379,
      "text": "他作为一种啊前本体论的力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 382379,
      "end_ms": 383579,
      "text": "它是不朽的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 383579,
      "end_ms": 385239,
      "text": "但是它不是人格化的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 385239,
      "end_ms": 386619,
      "text": "它也不是灵魂化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 386619,
      "end_ms": 389150,
      "text": "它不是实体化的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 389150,
      "end_ms": 390740,
      "text": "就精神不朽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 390740,
      "end_ms": 393140,
      "text": "革命精神不朽啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 394780,
      "end_ms": 396780,
      "text": "这种种人类解放的这种精神不朽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 396780,
      "end_ms": 398180,
      "text": "但是他不是人格化的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 398180,
      "end_ms": 399970,
      "text": "他不独属于某个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 399970,
      "end_ms": 401030,
      "text": "他不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 401030,
      "end_ms": 402850,
      "text": "针对到这谁的谁的灵魂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 402850,
      "end_ms": 404050,
      "text": "谁的人格就可以"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 404050,
      "end_ms": 405410,
      "text": "这个是永垂不朽的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 405410,
      "end_ms": 406330,
      "text": "没有的不存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 406330,
      "end_ms": 408240,
      "text": "这东西明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 408240,
      "end_ms": 411039,
      "text": "所以就不能有伟大灵魂崇拜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 411199,
      "end_ms": 412979,
      "text": "不能有伟大人格崇拜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 412979,
      "end_ms": 414699,
      "text": "不能有这个永恒人格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 414699,
      "end_ms": 417099,
      "text": "永恒灵魂的预想设想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 417099,
      "end_ms": 418079,
      "text": "有这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 418079,
      "end_ms": 420530,
      "text": "即非就不是无神论者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 420530,
      "end_ms": 421670,
      "text": "就要排除数据"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 421670,
      "end_ms": 422430,
      "text": "就要踢掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 422430,
      "end_ms": 423690,
      "text": "删掉这种人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 423690,
      "end_ms": 425610,
      "text": "要清退除名"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 427180,
      "end_ms": 427820,
      "text": "好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 427820,
      "end_ms": 429100,
      "text": "这不仅是炮打儒教了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 429100,
      "end_ms": 431680,
      "text": "他炮打很多这种什么领袖崇拜啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 431680,
      "end_ms": 433060,
      "text": "你就明白了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 433060,
      "end_ms": 436710,
      "text": "这幻想有这种这种不可能的灵魂人格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 436710,
      "end_ms": 438390,
      "text": "这东西是不可能不朽的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 438390,
      "end_ms": 439950,
      "text": "但是呢精神是可以不朽的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 439950,
      "end_ms": 443350,
      "text": "但是这个精神就不是他一个人独独断的垄断的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 443350,
      "end_ms": 445140,
      "text": "不是由他所带犹太索"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 445140,
      "end_ms": 447619,
      "text": "这个呃就明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 447619,
      "end_ms": 450259,
      "text": "就是啊他是人世间唯一的代理"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 450259,
      "end_ms": 454010,
      "text": "垄断性代理的不是这个东西啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 454010,
      "end_ms": 457210,
      "text": "所以这个只要你够能够坚持平等主义的一种观"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 457210,
      "end_ms": 461170,
      "text": "点观念的话啊就行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 464240,
      "end_ms": 465600,
      "text": "行吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 467500,
      "end_ms": 469400,
      "text": "乡村敢不跪就要被棍打"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 469400,
      "end_ms": 470800,
      "text": "那就打回去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 470800,
      "end_ms": 472020,
      "text": "你敢逼我跪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 472020,
      "end_ms": 472820,
      "text": "你打我一棍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 472820,
      "end_ms": 474660,
      "text": "我反打你一棍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 476880,
      "end_ms": 478320,
      "text": "哼你在搞笑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 479760,
      "end_ms": 480760,
      "text": "你如果是跪了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 480760,
      "end_ms": 481640,
      "text": "那就不是我们的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 481640,
      "end_ms": 482640,
      "text": "那就别别来了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 482640,
      "end_ms": 483350,
      "text": "你明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 483350,
      "end_ms": 484230,
      "text": "我都说了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 484230,
      "end_ms": 485610,
      "text": "我们放口子了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 485610,
      "end_ms": 488050,
      "text": "你如果是民俗被你直系家属"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 488050,
      "end_ms": 489190,
      "text": "直系近亲属"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 489190,
      "end_ms": 493720,
      "text": "就比如你的父母长辈要求父母要直系的啊要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 493720,
      "end_ms": 495420,
      "text": "那你可以逢迎一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 495420,
      "end_ms": 497780,
      "text": "因为我考虑到你们很多出生出生在这种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 497780,
      "end_ms": 498960,
      "text": "前天在农村"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 498960,
      "end_ms": 501890,
      "text": "那这个是而且这个是有前提"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 501890,
      "end_ms": 505090,
      "text": "只有在丧礼啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 505090,
      "end_ms": 508170,
      "text": "就是这个死掉的去祭拜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 508170,
      "end_ms": 513099,
      "text": "或者说是婚礼里面的这个改口礼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 513419,
      "end_ms": 514938,
      "text": "就这两个例外"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 514938,
      "end_ms": 516458,
      "text": "其他没有例外"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 516458,
      "end_ms": 519058,
      "text": "其他你不要说什么一群要个什么回去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 519058,
      "end_ms": 521190,
      "text": "莫名其妙要祭祖啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 521830,
      "end_ms": 524730,
      "text": "就是只能应直系近亲属"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 524730,
      "end_ms": 527170,
      "text": "直系亲属的要求跪爷爷奶奶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 527170,
      "end_ms": 527910,
      "text": "外公外婆"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 528990,
      "end_ms": 530150,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 530730,
      "end_ms": 532070,
      "text": "其他不允许跪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 532070,
      "end_ms": 534070,
      "text": "谁跪了就不是我们的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 534070,
      "end_ms": 537350,
      "text": "不要带他玩清掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 537350,
      "end_ms": 540310,
      "text": "这是要严格要有这个利润的立场的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 541790,
      "end_ms": 542490,
      "text": "好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 542490,
      "end_ms": 546860,
      "text": "做不到滚给老子滚啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 546860,
      "end_ms": 547640,
      "text": "就这个观点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 549840,
      "end_ms": 551360,
      "text": "Stand up"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 559680,
      "end_ms": 561380,
      "text": "这个应该是能做到的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 561380,
      "end_ms": 563440,
      "text": "你腿软不要来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 563870,
      "end_ms": 564430,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 564430,
      "end_ms": 565470,
      "text": "我们做生意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 565470,
      "end_ms": 566930,
      "text": "我们一群穷兄弟"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 566930,
      "end_ms": 568710,
      "text": "这奔个前头啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 568710,
      "end_ms": 569590,
      "text": "奔个前程"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 569590,
      "end_ms": 571010,
      "text": "奔个活头"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 571010,
      "end_ms": 573869,
      "text": "如果你这种人对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 573869,
      "end_ms": 577130,
      "text": "还还他妈的算命呢啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 577130,
      "end_ms": 580510,
      "text": "还有信信这个信那个是跪拜供奉的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 580510,
      "end_ms": 581650,
      "text": "这种人是不要的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 581650,
      "end_ms": 583329,
      "text": "是要清退掉的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 583329,
      "end_ms": 584529,
      "text": "严格讲啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 584529,
      "end_ms": 586129,
      "text": "这种人要清退掉的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 586129,
      "end_ms": 590030,
      "text": "那么把这个无神论的要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 590030,
      "end_ms": 592660,
      "text": "在生活当中坚持啊贯彻"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 592660,
      "end_ms": 595000,
      "text": "不要相信有什么超自然神秘力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 595000,
      "end_ms": 596900,
      "text": "不要相信有什么啊命定啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 596900,
      "end_ms": 597880,
      "text": "什么玩意啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 597880,
      "end_ms": 598800,
      "text": "这什么哎呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 598800,
      "end_ms": 599720,
      "text": "紫薇圣人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 599720,
      "end_ms": 602230,
      "text": "还有什么白头翁还是什么玩意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 603790,
      "end_ms": 606700,
      "text": "这些东西通通不准信也"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 606700,
      "end_ms": 608080,
      "text": "原则上不允许讨论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 608080,
      "end_ms": 610340,
      "text": "如果要讨论批判啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 610340,
      "end_ms": 612910,
      "text": "就是他就是本身就是啊统治集团"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 612910,
      "end_ms": 616190,
      "text": "或者说是啊协协会营私啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 616190,
      "end_ms": 618270,
      "text": "这个东西胡就是麻醉老百姓的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 618270,
      "end_ms": 620935,
      "text": "欺骗老百姓的欺骗性的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 623580,
      "end_ms": 629190,
      "text": "然后就是说嗯不得进行这个人格崇拜啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 629190,
      "end_ms": 629910,
      "text": "什么圣人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 629910,
      "end_ms": 630990,
      "text": "什么这东西的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 630990,
      "end_ms": 635330,
      "text": "凡是喜欢口必称这个圣那个圣的这种人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 635330,
      "end_ms": 636870,
      "text": "不带他玩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 636870,
      "end_ms": 637990,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 637990,
      "end_ms": 639570,
      "text": "人就是人普通的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 639570,
      "end_ms": 640920,
      "text": "平等的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 641280,
      "end_ms": 642400,
      "text": "称这个肾那个肾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 642400,
      "end_ms": 646860,
      "text": "这个肾那个肾的这种人清退清退好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 646860,
      "end_ms": 649780,
      "text": "发现他是这种轻浮顽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 649780,
      "end_ms": 652420,
      "text": "就是这种顽劣的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 652420,
      "end_ms": 654060,
      "text": "不是脚呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 654060,
      "end_ms": 656000,
      "text": "脚踏实地的这种人清退掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 656000,
      "end_ms": 658820,
      "text": "不要和他打交道"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 663139,
      "end_ms": 663939,
      "text": "明白吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 663939,
      "end_ms": 665819,
      "text": "就是这种都是落后思想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 665819,
      "end_ms": 670990,
      "text": "或者说都是某种嗯无纪律呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 670990,
      "end_ms": 672230,
      "text": "不严肃的表现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 672230,
      "end_ms": 674699,
      "text": "这些人是要退掉的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 674699,
      "end_ms": 678219,
      "text": "然后我们店里面店里面口必称卫生的人"
    },
